  "scope": "Modern AC1021/24/27/32 standard and application DXF DICTIONARYVAR represented schema280/value1 three-way transactions against a private immutable first-import raw baseline. Preserve raw-only and disjoint edits, agree on matching edits, refuse conflicts, retain unknown fields and unchanged absence/spelling, freeze planned output and inspect actual emission. Legacy canonical raw-authoritative behavior and DWG ownership/typed-output behavior are retained as separate routes; native semantics and arbitrary complete documents are not qualified.",
